$comment
DMSO linked job: B3LYP/6-311+G(d,p) opt with CPCM solvation in water,
then gas-phase frequency on the solvated-optimized geometry. The freq
job omits the $pcm/$solvent blocks to mimic Gaussian's "gas-phase freq
on solvated geometry" pattern.
$end

$molecule
0 1
S   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
O   0.000000   0.000000   1.530000
C   1.765000   0.000000  -0.490000
C  -1.765000   0.000000  -0.490000
H   1.900000   0.890000  -1.110000
H   1.900000  -0.890000  -1.110000
H   2.580000   0.000000   0.230000
H  -1.900000   0.890000  -1.110000
H  -1.900000  -0.890000  -1.110000
H  -2.580000   0.000000   0.230000
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE          opt
   METHOD           b3lyp
   BASIS            6-311+G(d,p)
   SOLVENT_METHOD   pcm
$end

$pcm
   THEORY    cpcm
   METHOD    SWIG
   SOLVER    INVERSION
$end

$solvent
   Dielectric    78.39
$end

@@@

$molecule
   READ
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE   freq
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-311+G(d,p)
$end
